		{
			dependencies: ["1AD8BB2D475052C7"]
			description: ["&7Deep within the dark, web-covered caverns of the Everdawn dimension lies the Arachnarch, a monstrous spider queen that has terrorized the land for centuries. Tales of her venomous bite and the deadly brood she commands have kept even the bravest adventurers at bay. Your quest is to venture into her lair, a maze of sticky webs and lurking spider minions, to confront the Arachnarch herself. Navigate the treacherous tunnels, avoid deadly ambushes, and prepare for a battle unlike any other. The Arachnarch's agility and venomous attacks will challenge your every move. Defeat her to put an end to her reign of terror and claim the precious loot hidden within her nest."]
			icon: "handcrafted:spider_trophy"
